Subject: [PATCH] First-run folder choice, strict CSP, layouts for any screen
 size

- Folders: a first visit asks where notes should live (a folder or this
  browser). Browsers without the folder API (Firefox, Safari, phones) show
  the reason instead of throwing when Open folder is clicked.
- Security: Content-Security-Policy with script hashes filled in by
  build.py; no network, no injected scripts or inline handlers.
- Screens: side panel floats and starts closed up to 900px; table columns
  keep a minimum width and scroll sideways; editor text grows gently and
  sits in a centred column at 1800px and wider.
- 02-core, 16-storage-ui, 44-shortcuts, 45-boot converted to const/let.
- Tests: csp_test, welcome_test, screens_test; returning-user flag for the
  seven tests that start from an empty browser.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
